{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52438","headline":"回波乐 八十一 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祭四时八节日（此句衍一字），家家总哭声。\n侍养不孝子，酒食祭先灵。\n将（一作「总」）被外鬼哭，家亲本无名。\n一郡巡门鬼，噇尽捖鸣（一作「椀名」）声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}